        "id": 7217,
        "name": "Chucho",
        "username": "Chucho",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-18T00:28:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, I just bought the game with both its expansions. I played it before with 3-4-5 people and its very fun but where i been running into proplems is when i play with me and one other person. The problem with me is that my gaming group is ussualy only me and one other person in rare cases i have more people involve so i was wondering if there are any house rules that i should consider?&nbsp; I honestly dont care about loosing but my gf or my brother do so yea. any help?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:26.479Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
